Ubuntu 20.04 local podman packages (not from apt).

Place the amd64 .deb set used with podman 3.4.2 here, for example:

  catatonit_*.deb
  conmon_*.deb
  containernetworking-plugins_*.deb
  containers-common_*.deb
  criu_*.deb
  crun_*.deb
  podman-machine-cni_*.deb
  podman-plugins_*.deb
  podman_3.4.2-*.deb
  slirp4netns_*.deb

Playbook 02 role podman installs these via dpkg when ubuntu_version=20.04.
Ubuntu 24.04 installs podman from apt instead; this directory is ignored.
